  "title": "industries.json",
  "description": "Minimal structural schema for industries.json, published by 3webs (AIVENTURE S.R.L.). Describes the top-level shape actually present in the live file; nested object internals are intentionally left permissive (additionalProperties: true) rather than over-specified.",
  "type": "object",
